classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ Phase 1 draft design (architecture only, no logic yet)

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +list~str~ preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(title: str) None
        +get_pending_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
        +priority_rank() int
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +list~Task~ scheduled_tasks
        +list~Task~ skipped_tasks
        +generate_plan() list~Task~
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" o-- "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> "1" Owner : plans for
    Scheduler ..> Task : schedules
